# Allerac One - "sales" profile (example).
# Core + the public Sales module only. Typically a lean public Unit
# (docs/operations/multi-unit.md). Merge into .env.<unit>.
# See docs/operations/modules-and-profiles.md.

ALLERAC_PROFILE=sales
# No module services: the scripts derive no extra Compose profile, so
# health-worker stays off.
# Lean public Unit (no executor, portainer, host monitoring or docs):
# COMPOSE_FILE=docker-compose.yml:docker-compose.public.yml
